    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2036, a tiny organism is born into a world overflowing with garbage and inhospitable to life due to environmental pollution. This small creature faces the dark reality of environmental pollution in this world covered with garbage. However, when it finds a photograph of a beautiful landscape, it begins to dream of a different reality. The creature embarks on a long journey to find a clean environment that it hopes might still exist somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Escape from a world ravaged by environmental pollution and find a beautiful place.<br>- Avoid obstacles made up of garbage and waste left by people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use objects bigger than the small creature to solve puzzles and escape.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2036, a tiny organism is born into a world overflowing with garbage and inhospitable to life due to environmental pollution. This small creature faces the dark reality of environmental pollution in this world covered with garbage. However, when it finds a photograph of a beautiful landscape, it begins to dream of a different reality. The creature embarks on a long journey to find a clean environment that it hopes might still exist somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Escape from a world ravaged by environmental pollution and find a beautiful place.<br>- Avoid obstacles made up of garbage and waste left by people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use objects bigger than the small creature to solve puzzles and escape.</p>",
    "short_description": "Is this world ruined by environmental pollution just a nightmare? Or is it our future?",
